"},"cast":[{"id":146785,"name":"Arata Furuta","role":"Papa (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qZToOt46sLeoKrFk3KH7cMFlkD5.jpg"},{"id":19588,"name":"Miyu Irino","role":"Bakabon (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8qEEhHUObNvGQr4e6eqLu5z4qTz.jpg"},{"id":55662,"name":"Noriko Hidaka","role":"Mama (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/43OuwsjqGf7JxpFpUvB75OdDDXQ.jpg"},{"id":220714,"name":"Ai Nonaka","role":"Hajime (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gEZVaoDeVK04HCmv0dJr6MGO9Se.jpg"},{"id":9706,"name":"Toshiyuki Morikawa","role":"Honkan (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hrzGBe4nokgkBNFekNo5hlXB2Bv.jpg"},{"id":81244,"name":"Akira Ishida","role":"Rerere no Oji-san (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jnW2Gn2NlR2uwOCeyOuzypnTmkH.jpg"},{"id":9705,"name":"Takahiro Sakurai","role":"Unagi-Inu (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8s8owcKmpRAuhzEGjSdRpztthUg.jpg"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","title":"Late night! The Genius Bakabon","overview":"La famiglia di Bakabon non è affatto una normale famiglia, di quelle che si sono sempre viste in giro; a partire da Bakabon stesso, monellaccio noto ai più per le sue birichinate, che non porta mai le mutande sotto al suo kimono. Per non parlare del padre di famiglia combina guai, diventato così dopo un incidente. O ancora il fratello minore Hajime-chan, nientedimeno che un bambino prodigio. Una famiglia fuori dal comune che si ritiene abbia potuto addirittura influenzare la nota serie statunitense The Simpson."},{"language":"en-US","title":"Late Night! The Genius Bakabon","overview":"Tensai Bakabon has been off the airwaves for almost 20 years! What's a Papa to do in dire times like the late 2010s? How about break every rule in the anime books, throw in celebrity guests, and take a nonsensical peek into the little things in modern life like otome games, blind dates, and the possibility that a series from the Showa era could make it to now! Is this really how it should be?!"},{"language":"ja-JP","overview":"ギャグ漫画の金字塔であり、赤塚不二夫の代表作とも言える「天才バカボン」が、前作から18年ぶりに、細川徹監督のオリジナルストーリーでTVアニメ化決定！ 「これでいいのだ！」でお馴染みバカボンのパパとそのファミリーに加え、本官やレレレのおじさん、ウナギイヌまで、超個性的な面々が、舞台を現代に変えてやりたい放題！赤塚不二夫没後10年にあたる2018年、“深夜”に繰り広げられる「バカボン」の新境地が、いよいよ幕を開ける！"}],"images":{"logos":[{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ig6YoWC7hUV7nmTZGN9rSs5eQob.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ig6YoWC7hUV7nmTZGN9rSs5eQob.png","language":"xx","width":414,"height":97}],"posters":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cUQ5vabTMiSSlhkgZ36Po72rLVf.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/cUQ5vabTMiSSlhkgZ36Po72rLVf.jpg","language":"en","width":680,"height":1000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rT4Hw1oQFarMW0gKFImlEF1p45m.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/rT4Hw1oQFarMW0gKFImlEF1p45m.jpg","language":"ja","width":680,"height":1000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4gBOr2i7MDsjW2KggoASDIyeRcC.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/4gBOr2i7MDsjW2KggoASDIyeRcC.jpg","language":"ja","width":680,"height":1000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fvAJMg4r4fw5YqCnBjkoFrdGOTn.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/fvAJMg4r4fw5YqCnBjkoFrdGOTn.jpg","language":"xx","width":640,"height":960}],"backdrops":[{"type":"backdrop","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/coMW1i8LvoH9mLeOrFPXmRKEXNR.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/coMW1i8LvoH9mLeOrFPXmRKEXNR.jpg","language":"ja","width":1280,"height":720},{"type":"backdrop","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cWPHrsjlcAdFk8vTKtAOaCsYpZ4.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/cWPHrsjlcAdFk8vTKtAOaCsYpZ4.jpg","language":"ja","width":1920,"height":1080},{"type":"backdrop","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/q